{"overview":{"Symbol":"GMRS","Name":"GMR Solutions Inc.","Description":"GMR Solutions Inc. operates as a provider of emergency medical services (EMS), essential alternate-site, out-of-hospital care, and mobile clinical practice groups in United States. It offers emergent medical services; non-emergent services; and other solutions, such as membership programs, standby and special events, national ambulance contract with the federal emergency management agency, and other state agency and health system contracts to coordinate EMS responses. It serves health systems, large regional systems, and smaller independent hospitals, local communities, health systems, payors, public health and local, state, and federal agencies. The company was incorporated in 2015 and is headquartered in Lewisville, Texas.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NYSE","Currency":"USD","Country":"United States","Sector":"Healthcare","Industry":"Medical Care Facilities","Address":"4400 Hwy 121, Lewisville, TX, 75056, United States","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"682708032","EBITDA":"1202012032","PERatio":"6.549223","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"9.239","DividendPerShare":"","DividendYield":"","EPS":"1.93","RevenuePerShareTTM":"127.689","ProfitMargin":"0.04709","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.15018","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"","RevenueTTM":"5829944832","GrossProfitTTM":"2280816896","DilutedEPSTTM":"1.93","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"1.797","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.066","AnalystTargetPrice":"19.375","TrailingPE":"6.549223","ForwardPE":"7.0855193","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"0.11710369","PriceToBookRatio":"1.3681134","EVToRevenue":"0.948","EVToEBITDA":"4.599","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"15","52WeekLow":"10.26","50DayMovingAverage":"11.954","200DayMovingAverage":"11.954","SharesOutstanding":"54011711","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"1063.135"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"GMR